{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/jetc3ut0","slide":11,"text":"E4 仅证明同一冻结候选池中的局部目标命中改善：QAOA 8/8 vs greedy 3/8，且选择差异只有 4/8 传到 logical QASM。\nE4-v2 是 AES 已在 E4 出现后的 post-E4 frozen replication，不是 held-out。primary native-2q 差为 -513.9375，95% CI [-2059.0625, 589.9375] 跨 0，generalization_claim=false。\nE5-v1.1 虽生成 90 行 ASCON/PRESENT 矩阵，但 ASCON 可调度 group 为 0、PRESENT 为 6，family-activity gate 失败。独立 negative audit 重建 90/90 行，仍明确 protocol_acceptance=false。\n因此 E5 没有 accepted endpoint，E4-v2 也没有支持性能改善。\n[Sources]\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e4-aes-bidirectional-pilot-v1-s520000/summary.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e4-v2-frozen-replication-v1-s530000-test/summary.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e4-v2-frozen-replication-v1-s530000-test/verifier.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e5-v11-ascon-primary-present-secondary-v1-s940000/summary.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e5-v11-negative-audit-v1-s950000/summary.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e5-v11-negative-audit-v1-s950000/verifier.json"}
