{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/8f2psfyx","slide":12,"text":"分层验证把语义正确性、调度实现、原生门与 bundle 完整性分别交给独立检查。\n当前集成树回归为 407 passed in 334.05s；legacy smoke 为 smoke ok。\n锚定 fresh-validation V2 的 383 passed in 295.779s 仅为历史冻结锚定，不代表当前集成树。\n交付外层检查记录 E4-v2 calibration 26/26、replication 32/32，E5 V3 current/fresh 20/20、fresh-v2 19/19；这些数字只表示证据链检查通过，不是性能成功率。\nE4-v2 calibration 只使用 12 个非 AES 函数和 72 个候选记录；replication 是 AES 已见坐标上的 64 条 post-E4 四臂复验。E5 portable V3 与 fresh-v2 只闭合跨 build 软件验证，仍明确 protocol_acceptance=false、experiment_completed=false，没有 accepted endpoint。\n35 页唯一中文主稿已同步 Overleaf origin/main c5c6993d1589469a61dfe18000a313d798b1c02f；本地 PDF SHA-256 为 f6a19cf8a7d2e245505777838a934f30219b378a063703784bf6cf535f908d8f。\n所有执行证据仍为 synthetic profile，hardware=false；无真机、量子加速或量子优势主张。\n[Sources]\n- docs/contracts/COMPETITION_ACCEPTANCE_MATRIX.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e4-v2-frozen-replication-v1-s530000-cal/verifier.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e4-v2-frozen-replication-v1-s530000-test/verifier.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e5-v11-portable-negative-audit-v3-s950000/verifier.json\n- experiments/results/xa202609/20260812-e5-v11-portable-fresh-validation-v2-s970000/verifier.json\n- docs/papers/resource_nmcts/chinese/main.tex\n- docs/papers/resource_nmcts/overleaf/worktree (origin/main c5c6993d1589469a61dfe18000a313d798b1c02f)\n- docs/papers/resource_nmcts/chinese/resource_nmcts_competition_current.pdf (SHA-256 f6a19cf8a7d2e245505777838a934f30219b378a063703784bf6cf535f908d8f)"}
