{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/q50nydsj","slide":13,"name":"文本框 1","text":"AI4Q｜置换等变 policy + 可验证 Neural MCTS\n把 Boolean 对称性写入结构先验；formal v4 只闭合 provenance，性能仍未验收。\n\nQ4AI｜同池 QAOA + execution-aware utility\nE2/E4 支持局部选择；E4-v2 CI 跨 0，E5 无 accepted endpoint。\n\nNEXT｜E6-MSO 多输出共享表达式\nVectorANF + shared action + compute–fanout–uncompute；显式 workspace peak≤2（MCT 分解未计）。\nmechanism MVP 尚无 shared head / QAOA replay / formal blind result；598→581 仅开发观察。","textPreview":"AI4Q｜置换等变 policy + 可验证 Neural MCTS | 把 Boolean 对称性写入结构先验；formal v4 只闭合 provenance，性能仍未验收。 |  | Q4AI｜同池 QAOA + execution-aware utility | E...","textChars":363,"textLines":9,"bbox":[36.13,155.13,1197.93,537]}
